WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.240
(Sonic Boom)

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.060
I don't know what to say, really.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.420
Three minutes...

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.200
...to the biggest battle of our professional lives...

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.240
(inspiring music begins softly)

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.640
...all comes down to today.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.020
Now either,

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.960
we heal...

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.120
...as a team

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.120
or we're gonna crumble.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.560
Inch by inch,

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.040
play by play,

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.480
til we're finished.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.940
We're in hell right now. gentlemen.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.940
Believe me.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.680
And...

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.520
We can stay here, get the s*** kicked out of us,

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:45.960
or...

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.020
we can fight our way back

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.100
into the light.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.100
We can climb outta hell,

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.000
One inch at a time.

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.540
Now I can't do it for ya.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.600
I'm too old.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.360
I look around, I see these young faces, and I think...

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.620
I mean...

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.740
I made every wrong choice a middle-aged man can make.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.580
I, uh,

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.460
I pissed away all my money,

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.980
believe it or not.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:28.160
I chased off anyone who's ever loved me.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.200
And lately,

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.240
I can't even stand the face I see in the mirror.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.300
Y'know, when you get old in life,

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.480
things get taken from you.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.980
I mean that's-- that's-- that's-- part of life.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:47.740
But...

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.840
you only learn that when you start losing stuff.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.260
You find out, life's this game of inches.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.100
So is football.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.140
Because in either game,

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.840
life or football,

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:06.080
the margin for error is so small, I mean...

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.260
one half a step too late, or too early,

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:10.780
and you don't quite make it.

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:13.280
One half-second too slow, too fast,

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:14.600
you don''t quite catch it.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:18.820
The inches we need everywhere around us.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:19.960
(Hell yeah!)

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.960
They're in every break of the game,

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.540
every minute, every second.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.340
(Cheers, claps)

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.460
On *this* team, we fight for that inch.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:36.660
On this team we tear ourselves, and everyone else around us to pieces...

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.060
...for that inch.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.360
(louder cheers, claps)

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.340
We claw with our fingernails, for that inch.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:44.600
Because we know...

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:47.060
when we add up all those inches,

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:49.940
thats gonna make the f***ing difference,

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.860
between *winning and losing!*

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.720
(even louder cheers, claps, hoots)

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.480
Between LIVING and DYING!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.700
I'll tell ya this, in any fight,

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:03.840
it's the guy, who's willing to die,

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.880
who's gonna win that inch.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.060
And I know, if I'm gonna have any life any more,

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:11.520
it's because I'm still willing

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.520
to fight --and die-- for that inch.

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:18.060
Because, that's what LIVING IS.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.220
The SIX INCHES... in front of your FACE!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.400
Now I can't MAKE ya do it.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.140
You gotta look at the guy next to ya,

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.920
look into his eyes,

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:32.900
now I think you're gonna see a guy who'll go that inch with you.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:33.720
(Hell yeah!)

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.440
You're gonna see a guy...

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.900
who will sacrifice himself for this team

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.840
because he knows, when it comes down to it,

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.020
you're gonna do the same for him.

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:45.280
(Yeah!)

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.720
That's the team, gentlemen.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.020
And...

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:53.120
either we heal, NOW... as a TEAM,

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.300
or we will die,

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.840
as individuals.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.480
That's football, guys.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:08.500
That's all it is.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.600
Now,

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.740
what are you gonna do?

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:19.260
(Epic, enthusiastic raucous)

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:21.260
(inspiring music rises)

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.540
(brand sound)

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.580
(sonic boom)

